beamline-tango-devices (1.0.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * tango-sim-magnet-link@.service: SuccessExitStatus=143. socat exits with
    status 143 when it is stopped (SIGTERM), so every stop of the magnet's
    link ended the unit "failed" (handbook Part 4, Ch35).

